  "description": "Production-ready OpenCL backend for DotCompute. Cross-platform GPU acceleration for NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, ARM Mali, and Qualcomm Adreno GPUs. Supports OpenCL 1.2+, Ring Kernels with atomic message queues, runtime kernel compilation, and multi-device workload distribution. Works with nvidia-opencl-icd, ROCm, intel-opencl-icd, and vendor drivers.",
